SELRTAC: the TLS certificate of the RTAC web server is now also collected during a pull (including ``--skip-scan``) if the scan didn't get it, controlled by the new ``sel.pull_ssl_cert`` option (default ``true``). It's fully parsed into ``x509``, written to ``ssl-certificate.pem``, and checked, with the DER and public key fingerprints, factory-default certificate, self-signed and expiry flags, and TLS version in ``extra.ssl_certificate`` and the HTTPS service.
